{"unit_id":"labring__sealos-skills#card-zh","repo":"labring/sealos-skills","commit":"a8e45c97b498c460901dcf526a874ee949a9e0ea","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Sealos 是面向 Sealos Cloud 的 DSH 技能插件，入口将 use-sealos 注册到会话技能目录。它指导代理通过模板商店、官方镜像或源码构建部署应用，也可创建 PostgreSQL、MySQL、MongoDB、Redis、Kafka 数据库和 S3 兼容对象存储，并检查状态、日志和公网 HTTPS。托管沙箱另有 Brain 部署与 Kaniko 构建流程。适合希望用自然语言部署和运维云应用的开发者；需要 Sealos 账户与 kubectl、Python，源码构建按路径需要 Docker/GitHub 或托管构建环境。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:15-38","plugins/sealos/skills/use-sealos/SKILL.md:78-109","plugins/sealos/skills/sealos-deploy/SKILL.md:71-94"]}
